sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant CLI as Typer CLI (`cisco-aibom`)
    participant Env as Env/Manifest Loader
    participant KB as DuckDB Loader
    participant Source as Source Resolver (FS/Docker)
    participant Parser as LibCST Parser
    participant WF as Workflow Index (AST)
    participant Categorizer
    participant LLM as LLM Provider (optional)
    participant Output as Report/API
    participant Post as Report Sender
    participant Reporter as `report` Subcommand

    User->>CLI: cisco-aibom analyze [sources...] [--images-file list.json]\n--output-format json|plaintext|api --output-file report.json
    CLI->>Env: load .env (AIBOM_ENV_FILE) + manifest.json
    Env-->>CLI: config (db path/sha, optional post_url from env)
    CLI->>KB: ensure_local_database()
    KB-->>CLI: CatalogDB(db_path)
    loop for each source
        CLI->>Source: detect local path vs Docker image
        alt container image
            Source->>Source: docker run + copy /app or site-packages
        end
        Source-->>CLI: python file list
        loop each Python file
            CLI->>Parser: parse_source_code(file)\n(assignments/decorators/annotations/context managers)
            Parser-->>CLI: CodeAnalysisResult
        end
        CLI->>WF: build_workflow_index(python_files)
        WF-->>CLI: WorkflowIndex
        CLI->>Categorizer: categorize_symbols(results, connector, llm_cfg, workflow_index)
        Categorizer->>KB: find_components_by_suffixes
        KB-->>Categorizer: catalog entries
        opt LLM enabled
            Categorizer->>LLM: extract model/tool details
            LLM-->>Categorizer: enriched attributes
        end
        Categorizer-->>CLI: components + relationships + workflows
        opt container source
            CLI->>CLI: map host paths to /app paths
        end
    end

    alt output_format == json
        CLI->>Output: _generate_json_report (metadata + summaries)
        opt post_url configured (flag/env)
            CLI->>Post: post_report_with_retries\n(x-cisco-ai-defense-tenant-api-key)
        end
    else output_format == plaintext
        CLI->>Output: _generate_plaintext_report
    else output_format == api
        CLI->>Output: start_api_server (FastAPI)
    end
    CLI-->>User: Rich summary (optional)

    User->>CLI: cisco-aibom report report.json [--raw-json]
    CLI->>Reporter: render summary/tables
    Reporter-->>User: console output
